{"id":25253,"imdb":"tt0057591","en":"Crooks in Clover","orig":"Les Tontons flingueurs","ar":null,"tag":null,"ov":"An aging gangster, Fernand Naudin is hoping for a quiet retirement when he suddenly inherits a fortune from an old friend, a former gangster supremo known as the Mexican. If he is ambivalent about his new found wealth, Fernand is positively nonplussed to discover that he has also inherited his benefactor’s daughter, Patricia. Unfortunately, not only does Fernand have to put up with the thoroughly modern Patricia and her nauseating boyfriend, but he also had to contend with the Mexican’s trigger-happy former employees, who are determined to make a claim.","rd":"1963-11-27","rt":111,"g":[35,80],"lang":"fr","budget":0,"revenue":0,"companies":[{"n":"Gaumont","logo":"/h4zSRszvKHr1tjqEp8voJVahuza.png","c":"FR"},{"n":"Corona Filmproduktion","logo":null,"c":"DE"},{"n":"Ultra Film - Sicila Cinematografica","logo":null,"c":""}],"countries":["FR","DE","IT"],"langs":["German","French","English"],"col":null,"rel":[{"c":"FR","d":"1963-11-27"}],"dir":["Georges Lautner"],"prod":["Alain Poiré","Robert Sussfeld","Irénée Leriche"],"wri":["Albert Simonin","Michel Audiard"],"mus":["Michel Magne"],"dop":["Maurice Fellous"],"cast":[{"n":"Lino Ventura","ch":"Fernand Naudin","p":"/curER6hJxl7c41FXmgmJHBip3uS.jpg"},{"n":"Bernard Blier","ch":"Raoul Volfoni","p":"/6xRHGb7CNDa83rcTzCp3LeIvU2s.jpg"},{"n":"Francis Blanche","ch":"Maître Folace","p":"/8XvzCHBH1HGyZGviAo8j6DouZvw.jpg"},{"n":"Claude Rich","ch":"Antoine Delafoy","p":"/pFKzxPQsAIbVsAhrDvp974U9Ras.jpg"},{"n":"Pierre Bertin","ch":"Adolphe Amédée Delafoy","p":"/q384IH4ZAVYabUd9ynR3NE8Jmkd.jpg"},{"n":"Jean Lefebvre","ch":"Paul Volfoni","p":"/4YCnvkYHj1lEk2JZxhKOUoOuJRB.jpg"},{"n":"Sabine Sinjen","ch":"Patricia, la fille de Louis \"le Mexicain\"","p":"/6MUZzW54yCKvXZCcRi8sg6u3vnD.jpg"},{"n":"Robert Dalban","ch":"Jean, le majordome","p":"/m7sUBO4BiJtRSv3wxFzAMN27YoO.jpg"},{"n":"Horst Frank","ch":"Théo","p":"/cU6CmyeTbCfamztBiS7im